# This git repository's root is the home directory. Only the actual
# project should ever be tracked here — everything else at this level
# (dotfiles, credentials, personal documents, unrelated projects, caches)
# is incidental and must never be staged, committed, or swept into a
# build/deploy archive by tools that walk the git working tree.
#
# Default-deny: ignore everything at this level, then explicitly
# re-allow only the real project directory.
#
# road-analysis-api was reorganized into road-risk-analysis/api (2026-10-14).
# Only that one subfolder is allowlisted — road-risk-analysis/model-training
# and road-risk-analysis/parked-vehicle-detection are deliberately left
# ignored here: each has its own independent .git repo and must never be
# swept into this (home-directory-rooted) repo as a nested/embedded one.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/road-risk-analysis/
/road-risk-analysis/*
!/road-risk-analysis/api/
